			"date": "2025-03-06T19:48:48.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> realistically I think the real answer is that its a push. We don't typically ask this about celebrity chefs or other professions. I think to the extent that developer celebrities have had a negative impact its less about the individual and more about them giving voice to problematic trends that exist within the industry.</p>",
