			},
			"date": "2025-03-06T19:57:42.210Z",
			"content": "<p><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@zachleat@fediverse.zachleat.com</a> was there a <em>rise</em> in developer celebrities? Perhaps I'm just not aware.</p>\n<p>I think software devs have been desperately trying to find somebody to emulate ever since the early days. It's all part of our massively shared imposter syndrome that all devs have to some degree :sweat_smile:</p>\n<p>It just gets icky when you call it <em>thought leadership</em>.</p>\n",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
